# Hand That Feeds: "Delirium - Whenever this creature attacks while there are four or more card types among cards in your
# graveyard, it gets +2/+0 and gains menace until end of turn." On turn 1 Bot1 casts the 2/2 with Mountain and Mox Ruby, then
# Black Lotus pays for a Wheel of Fortune that puts the Lotus (artifact), the Wheel (sorcery), an Ornithopter (artifact
# creature) and an Island (land) into Bot1's graveyard: artifact, sorcery, creature, land, exactly four types (CR 207.2c).
# On turn 3 it attacks: 4/2 with menace, so Bot2's lone Ornithopter cannot block it (menace, CR 702.111b) and Bot2 takes
# 4. The pump lasts until end of turn only (CR 514.2): on turn 4 it is a 2/2 without menace again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Wheel of Fortune
Ornithopter
Island
Mox Ruby
Hand That Feeds
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Ornithopter
Island x12

